"""Short closing sections that bring a few Karachi area pages above the word floor."""

PAGES = {}


def more(slug, text):
    PAGES[f"blogs/tax-consultant-{slug}.html"] = {"body_more": text}


more("new-karachi", "## Getting Started from New Karachi\n\nFactory owners usually start with a review of the last six months of sales tax returns and supplier lists, because input tax problems compound over time. Workers and traders need only a CNIC, bank statement and salary certificate or shop records; we prepare the return and explain it before submission.")
more("north-nazimabad-karachi", "## Getting Started\n\nShopkeepers should bring bank and card machine statements for the year, purchase bills and a closing stock list. Doctors need tax certificates from every hospital and a summary of private fees. With these, we prepare the return and wealth statement remotely and file after your approval.")
more("orangi-town-karachi", "## Community Organisations and Savings Groups\n\nOrangi has a long history of community savings groups and local organisations. Money received from or paid into a savings committee is not income, but large payouts used to buy assets should be noted in the wealth statement so the purchase is explained.")
more("pechs-karachi", "## Getting Started\n\nRetailers should share POS or card machine reports, purchase records and bank statements; office businesses their invoices, client tax certificates and SRB returns; landlords their tenancy agreements and tenants' deduction certificates. We combine these into one return and wealth statement for each owner.")
more("qasba-colony-karachi", "## Getting Started\n\nShare your CNIC, vehicle registration and tax receipts, contract or freight records and bank statements on WhatsApp. For families receiving remittances, add the bank advices for the year. We prepare the return in Urdu-friendly steps and explain each figure before filing.")
more("saddar-karachi", "## Getting Started\n\nTraders should prepare purchase invoices, a closing stock estimate and bank statements; importers their goods declarations and import tax receipts; professionals their client tax certificates. We review these together and file the return, with SRB returns where services are taxable in Sindh.")
more("shah-faisal-colony-karachi", "## Getting Started\n\nFor serving employees, the salary certificate and bank tax certificates are usually enough. Retirees should add their pension statement and National Savings certificates; shopkeepers their purchase bills and electricity bills. We prepare the return within a day or two and explain each figure.\n\nIf you are planning to buy property or a vehicle soon, file first so your name is on the Active Taxpayers List before the transaction.")
more("surjani-town-karachi", "## Getting Started\n\nSend your CNIC, bank statement and any salary certificate or shop records on WhatsApp. If you are paying instalments for a plot or house, include the receipts. We prepare a simple return and wealth statement and file it once you confirm the figures.")
more("timber-market-karachi", "## Getting Started\n\nImporters and dealers should prepare goods declarations, purchase and sales invoices, a stock statement by volume and bank statements. Sawmills should add electricity bills and wage records. We use these to prepare the return and, where registered, the monthly sales tax returns.\n\nDealers selling on long credit should also keep a receivables list at 30 June.")
